l,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5295817726","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122412#issuecomment-5295817726","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122412","id":5295817726,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABO6fD_g","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-14T16:41:05Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T16:46:52Z","body":"I guess whatever new LLVM version that this version of Emscripten is built on surfaced what looks to be a new warning, where it was detecting `editor_pid` in `main.cpp` as never actually being used in release templates, causing CI failures with `werror=yes`.\r\n\r\nI'm assuming `--editor-pid` is purely internal and only ever relevant for the editor, so I've now put `editor_pid` behind `TOOLS_ENABLED` to fix that warning.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5295817726/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},